21. Find Employees Who Joined in the Same Month

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import month,count

df.withColumn(
    "join_month",
    month("joining_date")
).groupBy("join_month") \
 .agg(count("*").alias("cnt")) \
 .filter("cnt > 1")

SQL:

SELECT MONTH(joining_date),
       COUNT(*)
FROM employee
GROUP BY MONTH(joining_date)
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;
